<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  What a signed Artemis is allowed to do on macOS.

  Every one of these is here because something breaks without it, not because
  it appeared in a template. The hardened runtime is deny by default, and the
  symptom of a missing entitlement is a process that dies on launch with a
  code signature error in Console and nothing at all in Artemis's own log.

    allow-jit
    allow-unsigned-executable-memory
    disable-executable-page-protection
      A JVM compiles bytecode to machine code and runs it, which is precisely
      what the hardened runtime exists to prevent. Artemis spawns Gradle, which
      IS a JVM, and Gradle spawns another for the game. Without these three the
      first build dies before Gradle prints a line.

    allow-dyld-environment-variables
    disable-library-validation
      Gradle and the game load native libraries that Apple did not sign: LWJGL's
      own dylibs, and whatever the JDK ships. Library validation refuses to load
      a library signed by a different team, which is all of them.

    files.user-selected.read-write
      The Open and Save dialogs. Without it a modder can pick a file and then
      watch the save fail.

    files.downloads.read-write
      Where a browser puts a .artemis someone was sent, which is the most likely
      place a project arrives from.

    network.client
      Fetching Gradle, the BTA manifest, halplibe's maven, and the update check.

    inherit
      Lives in the INHERIT file rather than this one for child processes, but is
      declared here too because electron-builder points both settings at this
      one plist; a helper that does not inherit gets none of the above.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
  <dict>
    <key>com.apple.security.cs.allow-jit</key>
    <true/>
    <key>com.apple.security.cs.allow-unsigned-executable-memory</key>
    <true/>
    <key>com.apple.security.cs.disable-executable-page-protection</key>
    <true/>
    <key>com.apple.security.cs.allow-dyld-environment-variables</key>
    <true/>
    <key>com.apple.security.cs.disable-library-validation</key>
    <true/>
    <key>com.apple.security.files.user-selected.read-write</key>
    <true/>
    <key>com.apple.security.files.downloads.read-write</key>
    <true/>
    <key>com.apple.security.network.client</key>
    <true/>
    <key>com.apple.security.inherit</key>
    <true/>
  </dict>
</plist>
